Audio Duration: 3m 0.4s (180.40s)
Start Time (Malaysia): 2026-11-10 08:29:48 +08
Detected Language: zh (Prob: 1.00)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Segment #1   [00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,280] | Elapsed:  17.29s | Words: 8  | Text: 你有个一两千万以后
Segment #2   [00:00:01,280 --> 00:00:02,580] | Elapsed:  17.29s | Words: 9  | Text: 你就不需要依赖任何人了
Segment #3   [00:00:02,580 --> 00:00:03,380] | Elapsed:  17.29s | Words: 6  | Text: 你谁都用不着
Segment #4   [00:00:03,380 --> 00:00:05,340] | Elapsed:  17.29s | Words: 10 | Text: 有一千万的人出来的那种状态
Segment #5   [00:00:05,340 --> 00:00:06,580] | Elapsed:  17.29s | Words: 5  | Text: 这是人的本性
Segment #6   [00:00:06,580 --> 00:00:08,820] | Elapsed:  17.29s | Words: 11 | Text: 你们现在出来社交给人和平共处
Segment #7   [00:00:08,820 --> 00:00:09,540] | Elapsed:  17.29s | Words: 4  | Text: 赔这个笑点
Segment #8   [00:00:09,540 --> 00:00:10,920] | Elapsed:  17.29s | Words: 7  | Text: 照顾别人的情绪
Segment #9   [00:00:10,920 --> 00:00:11,760] | Elapsed:  17.29s | Words: 4  | Text: 主要的原因
Segment #10  [00:00:11,760 --> 00:00:12,840] | Elapsed:  17.29s | Words: 4  | Text: 还是你们没钱
Segment #11  [00:00:12,840 --> 00:00:13,940] | Elapsed:  17.29s | Words: 5  | Text: 你需要去社交
Segment #12  [00:00:13,940 --> 00:00:14,840] | Elapsed:  17.29s | Words: 4  | Text: 需要去换吧
Segment #13  [00:00:14,840 --> 00:00:15,940] | Elapsed:  17.29s | Words: 6  | Text: 拿你有的换你要的
Segment #14  [00:00:15,940 --> 00:00:16,240] | Elapsed:  17.29s | Words: 2  | Text: 对不对
Segment #15  [00:00:16,240 --> 00:00:16,700] | Elapsed:  17.29s | Words: 3  | Text: 互相换
Segment #16  [00:00:16,700 --> 00:00:17,880] | Elapsed:  17.29s | Words: 6  | Text: 给自己留条后路
Segment #17  [00:00:17,880 --> 00:00:19,740] | Elapsed:  17.29s | Words: 10 | Text: 你这样你才每天赔这个笑点
Segment #18  [00:00:19,740 --> 00:00:20,840] | Elapsed:  17.29s | Words: 4  | Text: 但是这个东西
Segment #19  [00:00:20,840 --> 00:00:22,040] | Elapsed:  17.29s | Words: 6  | Text: 它不是真实的你
Segment #20  [00:00:22,040 --> 00:00:23,440] | Elapsed:  17.29s | Words: 8  | Text: 有些时候你不想说话
Segment #21  [00:00:23,440 --> 00:00:24,100] | Elapsed:  17.29s | Words: 4  | Text: 但是为了生活
Segment #22  [00:00:24,100 --> 00:00:24,940] | Elapsed:  17.29s | Words: 6  | Text: 你得恶于奉承
Segment #23  [00:00:24,940 --> 00:00:25,580] | Elapsed:  17.29s | Words: 2  | Text: 对吧
Segment #24  [00:00:25,580 --> 00:00:27,280] | Elapsed:  17.29s | Words: 11 | Text: 但是人一旦有了几千万以后
Segment #25  [00:00:27,280 --> 00:00:28,520] | Elapsed:  17.30s | Words: 6  | Text: 你吃喝不除了
Segment #26  [00:00:28,520 --> 00:00:29,620] | Elapsed:  37.46s | Words: 6  | Text: 你房子也有了
Segment #27  [00:00:29,620 --> 00:00:30,360] | Elapsed:  37.46s | Words: 4  | Text: 车也有了
Segment #28  [00:00:30,360 --> 00:00:31,820] | Elapsed:  37.46s | Words: 8  | Text: 你有了稳定的生活来源
Segment #29  [00:00:31,820 --> 00:00:32,780] | Elapsed:  37.46s | Words: 4  | Text: 所以说这个时候
Segment #30  [00:00:32,780 --> 00:00:34,280] | Elapsed:  37.46s | Words: 9  | Text: 人出来装逼是很正常的
Segment #31  [00:00:34,280 --> 00:00:35,440] | Elapsed:  37.46s | Words: 5  | Text: 我不跟你说话为什么
Segment #32  [00:00:35,440 --> 00:00:36,460] | Elapsed:  37.46s | Words: 6  | Text: 因为我用不着你
Segment #33  [00:00:36,460 --> 00:00:37,880] | Elapsed:  37.46s | Words: 8  | Text: 我不需要你任何的东西
Segment #34  [00:00:37,880 --> 00:00:39,540] | Elapsed:  37.46s | Words: 10 | Text: 我没有谁我都可以活得更好
Segment #35  [00:00:39,540 --> 00:00:40,560] | Elapsed:  37.46s | Words: 5  | Text: 就是我所有的朋友
Segment #36  [00:00:40,560 --> 00:00:42,120] | Elapsed:  37.46s | Words: 10 | Text: 明天出面都被他创设了
Segment #37  [00:00:42,120 --> 00:00:43,040] | Elapsed:  37.46s | Words: 5  | Text: 跟我有什么关系
Segment #38  [00:00:43,040 --> 00:00:44,020] | Elapsed:  37.46s | Words: 5  | Text: 我照样有钱
Segment #39  [00:00:44,020 --> 00:00:45,920] | Elapsed:  37.46s | Words: 6  | Text: 所以说有了钱的人
Segment #40  [00:00:45,920 --> 00:00:47,120] | Elapsed:  37.46s | Words: 6  | Text: 他都是冷血不行的
Segment #41  [00:00:47,120 --> 00:00:48,480] | Elapsed:  37.46s | Words: 8  | Text: 我再给你举个例子
Segment #42  [00:00:48,480 --> 00:00:49,360] | Elapsed:  37.46s | Words: 6  | Text: 就像借钱一样
Segment #43  [00:00:49,860 --> 00:00:51,440] | Elapsed:  37.46s | Words: 9  | Text: 你跟一个有100万块钱的人
Segment #44  [00:00:51,440 --> 00:00:52,440] | Elapsed:  37.46s | Words: 7  | Text: 借10万块钱好借
Segment #45  [00:00:52,440 --> 00:00:54,300] | Elapsed:  37.46s | Words: 10 | Text: 但是你跟一个有2000万块钱的人
Segment #46  [00:00:54,300 --> 00:00:55,580] | Elapsed:  37.46s | Words: 7  | Text: 借10万块钱不好借
Segment #47  [00:00:55,580 --> 00:00:56,880] | Elapsed:  37.46s | Words: 6  | Text: 有100万块钱的人
Segment #48  [00:00:56,880 --> 00:00:57,380] | Elapsed:  37.46s | Words: 4  | Text: 你借10万
Segment #49  [00:00:57,380 --> 00:00:57,940] | Elapsed:  37.46s | Words: 6  | Text: 你给他打电话
Segment #50  [00:00:57,940 --> 00:00:58,720] | Elapsed:  57.64s | Words: 4  | Text: 那好兄弟
Segment #51  [00:00:58,720 --> 00:01:00,180] | Elapsed:  57.64s | Words: 7  | Text: 我下个月买房子
Segment #52  [00:01:00,180 --> 00:01:00,960] | Elapsed:  57.64s | Words: 5  | Text: 缺10万块钱
Segment #53  [00:01:00,960 --> 00:01:01,900] | Elapsed:  57.64s | Words: 4  | Text: 我就用一个月
Segment #54  [00:01:01,900 --> 00:01:02,740] | Elapsed:  57.64s | Words: 6  | Text: 下个月还给你
Segment #55  [00:01:02,740 --> 00:01:04,280] | Elapsed:  57.64s | Words: 8  | Text: 他如果说有100万块钱
Segment #56  [00:01:04,280 --> 00:01:05,920] | Elapsed:  57.64s | Words: 13 | Text: 他借给你10万块钱的核心是什么
Segment #57  [00:01:05,920 --> 00:01:07,140] | Elapsed:  57.64s | Words: 7  | Text: 他内心的想法是
Segment #58  [00:01:07,660 --> 00:01:09,440] | Elapsed:  57.64s | Words: 9  | Text: 我今天借给你10万块钱
Segment #59  [00:01:09,440 --> 00:01:11,380] | Elapsed:  57.64s | Words: 9  | Text: 等到哪天我需要用钱的时候
Segment #60  [00:01:11,380 --> 00:01:12,140] | Elapsed:  57.64s | Words: 5  | Text: 我会问你借
Segment #61  [00:01:12,140 --> 00:01:13,120] | Elapsed:  57.64s | Words: 6  | Text: 你也能帮帮我
Segment #62  [00:01:13,120 --> 00:01:15,420] | Elapsed:  57.64s | Words: 12 | Text: 将来说不准还能留一条后路
Segment #63  [00:01:15,420 --> 00:01:16,080] | Elapsed:  57.64s | Words: 3  | Text: 但是如果说
Segment #64  [00:01:16,080 --> 00:01:17,960] | Elapsed:  57.64s | Words: 10 | Text: 你去跟一个有2000万块钱的人
Segment #65  [00:01:17,960 --> 00:01:19,100] | Elapsed:  57.64s | Words: 6  | Text: 去借10万块钱
Segment #66  [00:01:19,100 --> 00:01:19,940] | Elapsed:  57.64s | Words: 4  | Text: 他会告诉你说
Segment #67  [00:01:19,940 --> 00:01:21,120] | Elapsed:  57.64s | Words: 3  | Text: 兄弟不好意思
Segment #68  [00:01:21,120 --> 00:01:22,620] | Elapsed:  57.64s | Words: 8  | Text: 我最近跟我老婆闹离婚
Segment #69  [00:01:22,620 --> 00:01:23,880] | Elapsed:  57.64s | Words: 8  | Text: 钱都在我老婆手里
Segment #70  [00:01:23,880 --> 00:01:25,660] | Elapsed:  57.64s | Words: 9  | Text: 或者说我现在都买了基金
Segment #71  [00:01:25,660 --> 00:01:26,640] | Elapsed:  57.64s | Words: 4  | Text: 买了理财
Segment #72  [00:01:26,640 --> 00:01:27,620] | Elapsed:  57.64s | Words: 6  | Text: 我手里没有现金
Segment #73  [00:01:27,620 --> 00:01:29,000] | Elapsed:  81.09s | Words: 7  | Text: 就是为什么不借给你钱
Segment #74  [00:01:29,000 --> 00:01:30,020] | Elapsed:  81.09s | Words: 3  | Text: 因为不需要
Segment #75  [00:01:30,020 --> 00:01:31,260] | Elapsed:  81.09s | Words: 7  | Text: 他不需要你还人情
Segment #76  [00:01:31,260 --> 00:01:32,160] | Elapsed:  81.09s | Words: 3  | Text: 我告诉你
Segment #77  [00:01:32,160 --> 00:01:34,480] | Elapsed:  81.10s | Words: 11 | Text: 有钱人他一辈子用不着你
Segment #78  [00:01:34,480 --> 00:01:35,460] | Elapsed:  81.10s | Words: 5  | Text: 有钱人他就是
Segment #79  [00:01:35,460 --> 00:01:36,720] | Elapsed:  81.10s | Words: 6  | Text: 尊讯自我的内心
Segment #80  [00:01:36,720 --> 00:01:37,580] | Elapsed:  81.10s | Words: 5  | Text: 就这种状况
Segment #81  [00:01:37,580 --> 00:01:39,520] | Elapsed:  81.10s | Words: 9  | Text: 越有钱的人越不讲感情
Segment #82  [00:01:39,520 --> 00:01:41,180] | Elapsed:  81.10s | Words: 8  | Text: 一个有几千万块钱的人
Segment #83  [00:01:41,180 --> 00:01:42,640] | Elapsed:  81.10s | Words: 6  | Text: 他如果说讲感情
Segment #84  [00:01:42,640 --> 00:01:44,320] | Elapsed:  81.10s | Words: 11 | Text: 他这些钱早就被人骗光了
Segment #85  [00:01:44,320 --> 00:01:45,780] | Elapsed:  81.10s | Words: 8  | Text: 我可能有的朋友听不懂
Segment #86  [00:01:45,780 --> 00:01:47,100] | Elapsed:  81.10s | Words: 7  | Text: 这都是渲染的教训
Segment #87  [00:01:47,100 --> 00:01:48,400] | Elapsed:  81.10s | Words: 8  | Text: 有钱人也用不着你
Segment #88  [00:01:48,400 --> 00:01:49,880] | Elapsed:  81.10s | Words: 9  | Text: 因为你的那些关系和资源
Segment #89  [00:01:49,880 --> 00:01:50,820] | Elapsed:  81.10s | Words: 5  | Text: 也都是底层的
Segment #90  [00:01:50,820 --> 00:01:52,420] | Elapsed:  81.10s | Words: 10 | Text: 万一哪一天有钱人倒了
Segment #91  [00:01:52,420 --> 00:01:53,200] | Elapsed:  81.10s | Words: 6  | Text: 也指望不上你
Segment #92  [00:01:53,200 --> 00:01:54,100] | Elapsed:  81.10s | Words: 4  | Text: 你跟我借钱
Segment #93  [00:01:54,100 --> 00:01:55,040] | Elapsed:  81.10s | Words: 7  | Text: 我为什么要借给你呢
Segment #94  [00:01:55,040 --> 00:01:56,080] | Elapsed:  81.10s | Words: 7  | Text: 我给你编个理由
Segment #95  [00:01:56,080 --> 00:01:57,000] | Elapsed:  81.10s | Words: 7  | Text: 我说属于没钱了
Segment #96  [00:01:57,000 --> 00:01:58,060] | Elapsed: 102.70s | Words: 8  | Text: 我说我投资基金了
Segment #97  [00:01:58,060 --> 00:01:59,500] | Elapsed: 102.70s | Words: 8  | Text: 这已经是很尊重你了
Segment #98  [00:01:59,500 --> 00:02:00,420] | Elapsed: 102.70s | Words: 6  | Text: 你如果说换都是我
Segment #99  [00:02:00,860 --> 00:02:02,040] | Elapsed: 102.70s | Words: 8  | Text: 如果有个人给我打电话
Segment #100 [00:02:02,040 --> 00:02:03,620] | Elapsed: 102.70s | Words: 10 | Text: 多年不联系的同学发小
Segment #101 [00:02:03,920 --> 00:02:05,320] | Elapsed: 102.70s | Words: 9  | Text: 十年八年不打一个电话
Segment #102 [00:02:05,320 --> 00:02:06,780] | Elapsed: 102.70s | Words: 7  | Text: 突然打了个电话
Segment #103 [00:02:06,780 --> 00:02:07,920] | Elapsed: 102.70s | Words: 6  | Text: 直接上来借钱的
Segment #104 [00:02:07,920 --> 00:02:08,580] | Elapsed: 102.70s | Words: 4  | Text: 我直接就拉
Segment #105 [00:02:08,580 --> 00:02:09,340] | Elapsed: 102.70s | Words: 4  | Text: 就是这种人
Segment #106 [00:02:09,340 --> 00:02:10,680] | Elapsed: 102.70s | Words: 10 | Text: 你跟他多一秒钟的结束
Segment #107 [00:02:10,680 --> 00:02:12,400] | Elapsed: 102.70s | Words: 10 | Text: 都是对于我自己生命的浪费
Segment #108 [00:02:12,400 --> 00:02:13,100] | Elapsed: 102.70s | Words: 2  | Text: 那当然
Segment #109 [00:02:13,100 --> 00:02:14,320] | Elapsed: 102.70s | Words: 7  | Text: 我也不怕别人骂我
Segment #110 [00:02:14,320 --> 00:02:15,140] | Elapsed: 102.70s | Words: 3  | Text: 你骂我
Segment #111 [00:02:15,140 --> 00:02:16,080] | Elapsed: 102.70s | Words: 6  | Text: 说明我过得好
Segment #112 [00:02:16,080 --> 00:02:16,620] | Elapsed: 102.70s | Words: 2  | Text: 对不对
Segment #113 [00:02:16,620 --> 00:02:17,620] | Elapsed: 102.70s | Words: 4  | Text: 宁要人骂
Segment #114 [00:02:17,620 --> 00:02:18,400] | Elapsed: 102.70s | Words: 4  | Text: 莫要人脸
Segment #115 [00:02:18,400 --> 00:02:19,580] | Elapsed: 102.70s | Words: 5  | Text: 我宁愿做一个
Segment #116 [00:02:19,580 --> 00:02:20,980] | Elapsed: 102.70s | Words: 9  | Text: 背负的所有骂名的坏人
Segment #117 [00:02:20,980 --> 00:02:21,960] | Elapsed: 102.70s | Words: 7  | Text: 我也不愿意去做一个
Segment #118 [00:02:21,960 --> 00:02:23,500] | Elapsed: 102.70s | Words: 11 | Text: 在生业里拨头痛苦的好人
Segment #119 [00:02:23,500 --> 00:02:24,140] | Elapsed: 123.25s | Words: 4  | Text: 这就是真理
Segment #120 [00:02:24,460 --> 00:02:26,560] | Elapsed: 123.25s | Words: 14 | Text: 一个人一旦有了几千万几个亿以后
Segment #121 [00:02:26,560 --> 00:02:28,220] | Elapsed: 123.25s | Words: 11 | Text: 他就不再需要任何的机会了
Segment #122 [00:02:28,220 --> 00:02:29,740] | Elapsed: 123.25s | Words: 8  | Text: 他只需要做好他的业务
Segment #123 [00:02:29,740 --> 00:02:30,980] | Elapsed: 123.25s | Words: 8  | Text: 和保护好他的钱就好了
Segment #124 [00:02:30,980 --> 00:02:33,300] | Elapsed: 123.25s | Words: 9  | Text: 这个时候就是拒绝一切机会
Segment #125 [00:02:33,300 --> 00:02:34,900] | Elapsed: 123.25s | Words: 8  | Text: 不跟任何人讲面子
Segment #126 [00:02:34,900 --> 00:02:36,480] | Elapsed: 123.25s | Words: 9  | Text: 就是别人给你聊什么道德
Segment #127 [00:02:36,480 --> 00:02:37,380] | Elapsed: 123.25s | Words: 4  | Text: 同情帮助
Segment #128 [00:02:37,380 --> 00:02:38,180] | Elapsed: 123.25s | Words: 7  | Text: 就以后再让他滚
Segment #129 [00:02:38,180 --> 00:02:39,380] | Elapsed: 123.25s | Words: 4  | Text: 就是跟所有人
Segment #130 [00:02:39,380 --> 00:02:40,780] | Elapsed: 123.26s | Words: 9  | Text: 都要有非常短暂的结束
Segment #131 [00:02:40,780 --> 00:02:42,020] | Elapsed: 123.26s | Words: 7  | Text: 你不能跟任何比你
Segment #132 [00:02:42,020 --> 00:02:42,740] | Elapsed: 123.26s | Words: 4  | Text: 穷的人交朋友
Segment #133 [00:02:42,740 --> 00:02:43,160] | Elapsed: 123.26s | Words: 2  | Text: 甚至
Segment #134 [00:02:43,160 --> 00:02:44,780] | Elapsed: 123.26s | Words: 8  | Text: 你也不能跟任何比你
Segment #135 [00:02:44,780 --> 00:02:45,520] | Elapsed: 123.26s | Words: 4  | Text: 负的人交朋友
Segment #136 [00:02:45,520 --> 00:02:46,600] | Elapsed: 123.26s | Words: 5  | Text: 你就做自己的事
Segment #137 [00:02:46,600 --> 00:02:48,380] | Elapsed: 123.26s | Words: 9  | Text: 如果说你听不懂我这个话
Segment #138 [00:02:48,380 --> 00:02:50,020] | Elapsed: 123.26s | Words: 9  | Text: 你现在这几千万几百万
Segment #139 [00:02:50,020 --> 00:02:50,720] | Elapsed: 123.26s | Words: 5  | Text: 或者说几个亿
Segment #140 [00:02:50,720 --> 00:02:52,120] | Elapsed: 123.26s | Words: 8  | Text: 都会被别人骗走的
Segment #141 [00:02:52,120 --> 00:02:53,020] | Elapsed: 132.42s | Words: 6  | Text: 我再补充一句
Segment #142 [00:02:53,020 --> 00:02:54,580] | Elapsed: 132.42s | Words: 11 | Text: 这个视频的总结还就一句话
Segment #143 [00:02:54,900 --> 00:02:56,420] | Elapsed: 132.42s | Words: 7  | Text: 人这辈子不需要朋友
Segment #144 [00:02:56,420 --> 00:02:57,300] | Elapsed: 132.42s | Words: 5  | Text: 所有人都是负担
Segment #145 [00:02:57,300 --> 00:02:58,420] | Elapsed: 132.42s | Words: 4  | Text: 你只有你自己
Segment #146 [00:02:58,420 --> 00:02:59,240] | Elapsed: 132.42s | Words: 5  | Text: 家人我生日
Segment #147 [00:02:59,240 --> 00:03:00,200] | Elapsed: 132.42s | Words: 6  | Text: 祝你们越来越好
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
